      "relative_start_time": "00:01:29",
      "translated_text": "",
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
      "original_text": "对，其实作为一个企业啊，你酒香也怕橡子沉。所以你必须要最好的方式，最好的这个空间来展示你的产品。我们这个展厅里面。",
      "source_language": "中文",
      "end_time": "00:01:40",
      "relative_end_time": "00:01:40",
      "target_language": ""
    },
    {
      "language": "中文",
      "translated_text": "",
      "start_time": "00:01:40",
      "relative_start_time": "00:01:40",
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
      "original_text": "最明星的产品是哪一个",
